{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan changed (material) after the first real-data run; a fresh plan review follows. Findings from that run, on a TMPDIR fetch of origin/tickets e7a0476397f (2026-11-16 19:34 PST), published only to a file:// fake remote:\n1. Blobless pack measured 639,372 KiB before and 105,216 KiB after (delta 534,156 KiB; after = 102.8 MiB, against the predicted 365-380 MiB). 13,208 commits in the rewritten history.\n2. The reduced state differed in authorship_ledger only, for 7,817 of 10,280 tickets: the ledger position.commit_sha values, which the reclaim re-resolves by design. Ignoring that field the state is equal. The harness's comparison was wrong; it now ignores that field.\n3. The rewritten ledger anchor was not on the branch, so enforce_since grandfathered every event. That was a pre-existing S1 defect, now filed, fixed and merged as euhedral-svelte-chimpanzee (Gerrit 3413, b45a4b7f8ef).\n4. Enforced verify-identity --all did not finish within 2 hours on either the before or the after copy (both runs hit the bound), and the after run spent its time in one full-history git log per below-checkpoint ledger position; filed as tame-melodious-veery. Advisory mode (what CI runs today) reported 49,438 signed / 874 unsigned of 50,312 events, identical before and after.\nThe harness now compares enforced verdict counts before and after instead of requiring exit 0 (real stores contain unsigned events), and also asserts enforce_since is an ancestor of the new tip. A second real-data run on the amended harness started 2026-11-17 against origin/tickets in a fresh TMPDIR workdir (GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES set, no remote, file:// publish only), bounded at 8 hours."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1794947878870789965,"uuid":"bc3f0163-1c3d-477e-b3aa-d8ec9fe4e36d"}